msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"...Now listen, Yoko never came home yesterday. I know you\r\n"
"girls are with her a lot, so please... Did you happen to see\r\n"
"my daughter anywhere?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"She forgot something at school yesterday and went back for\r\n"
"it. That's the last time I saw her, in front of the station."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"She never came home? Yoko doesn't seem like the type that\r\n"
"would run away..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Maybe she was kidnapped by the <Color:7>Phantom Tour Guide<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Haruko! Don't say that! Especially not in front of\r\n"
"her mother!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "What's this \"Phantom Tour Guide\" all about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"It's just a silly rumor going around, like an urban legend\r\n"
"or something. Don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Still, there might be some truth to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"I asked a shopkeeper in this area, and he said he saw a\r\n"
"<Color:7>high school girl<Color:Default> walking with a "
"<Color:7>foreigner<Color:Default> yesterday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Could that high school girl have been my Yoko!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"But that \"phantom\" stuff's gotta be a rumor! If people were\r\n"
"vanishing around the travel agency, it would've been a\r\n"
"huge news story by now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"I suppose you're right. But still, a high school girl\r\n"
"walking with a foreigner? That could have something\r\n"
"to do with my Yoko..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"But that \"phantom\" stuff's gotta be a rumor! If people were\r\n"
"actually vanishing around the travel agency, it would've\r\n"
"been a huge news story by now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"I suppose you're right. But still, a high school girl walking\r\n"
"alone with a foreigner? That could very well have something\r\n"
"to do with my Yoko..."
msgstr ""

